<view class="page recharge-page" style="{{appearanceStyle}}">
  <view class="balance-card"><text>账户余额</text><text class="balance">¥{{balanceCents / 100}}</text><text>本金 ¥{{principalCents / 100}} · 赠送金 ¥{{bonusCents / 100}}</text></view>
  <view class="section-title"><text>充值优惠</text><text>{{message}}</text></view>
  <view class="rule-grid" wx:if="{{rules.length}}">
    <view class="rule {{selectedMode === 'RULE' && selectedRuleId === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{rules}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseRule"><text>¥{{item.rechargeText}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.giftCents}}">赠 ¥{{item.giftText}}</text><text wx:else>{{item.name}}</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="custom-recharge {{selectedMode === 'CUSTOM' ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:if="{{available}}">
    <view><text>自定义金额</text><text>不享赠送</text></view>
    <view class="custom-input"><text>¥</text><input type="digit" value="{{customAmount}}" placeholder="{{customAmountPlaceholder}}" bindinput="setCustomAmount" /></view>
    <text>可充值 ¥{{minRechargeText}} 至 ¥{{maxRechargeText}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="unavailable" wx:if="{{!loading && !available}}"><text>储值服务暂未开通</text><text>开通后可在这里选择储值优惠并查看余额，具体开放时间请关注门店通知。</text></view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载充值规则…</view>
  <view class="safety"><text>会员与储值说明</text><text>优惠档位按页面规则赠送金额；自定义充值只增加本金。储值活动可重复参与，但不会把您切换到更低会员等级。</text></view>
  <button class="primary recharge-button" wx:if="{{available}}" loading="{{recharging}}" disabled="{{recharging || !canRecharge}}" bindtap="recharge">{{rechargeButtonText}}</button>
</view>
